{"pull": {"id": "number:21996", "number": 21996, "title": "KAFKA-20155: Implement lazy header deserialization for state stores", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-04-08T10:42:34Z", "closed_at": "2026-10-15T03:42:56Z", "merged_at": null, "user": {"login": "Shekharrajak", "id": 5774448, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU3NzQ0NDg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5774448?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak", "html_url": "https://github.com/Shekharrajak", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Shekharrajak/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Ref https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20155\r\n\r\nWhen reading from header-aware state stores (KIP-1271), header bytes embedded in store values are eagerly deserialized into RecordHeaders even when the downstream value deserializer does not use them. This PR introduces LazyHeaders -- a lazy Headers implementation that defers parsing until first read access, avoiding unnecessary work in header-agnostic deserialization paths.\r\n\r\n**Changes:**\r\n\r\nValueTimestampHeadersDeserializer.deserialize() -- calls HeadersDeserializer.deserialize(rawHeaders) and passes the result to the value deserializer\r\nUtils.readHeaders() -- called by AggregationWithHeadersDeserializer for session store rea